# Select an environment from http-client.env.json in Rider's "Run with" menu.
# A value named apiToken in http-client.private.env.json overrides this OS variable.
@apiToken = {{$env.OFFICEDAYS_API_TOKEN}}

### Record today as an office day (iOS Shortcut request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Manually record a past office day
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/2026-09-15
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### List attendance for a month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?year=2026&month=9
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Remove an attendance day
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/2026-09-15
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Explicitly record today as automatic (same default as no body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isManual": false
}

### Record today as manual
# An existing date keeps its original source; remove it first to test creation again.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isManual": true
}
